    "Apple Intelligence is turned off. Turn it on in System Settings, then Apple Intelligence and Siri.": {
      "comment": "OnDeviceAI (Sources/Features/OnDeviceAI/Core/AppleIntelligenceBackend.swift:27). machine-translated, owner review pending.",
