    "If the host gives none, you type the server.": {
      "comment": "WelcomeMac (Sources/Features/WelcomeMac/WelcomeRoutes.swift:84). machine-translated, owner review pending.",
      "extractionState": "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
