    "Saved for this session only. The app's core has no command yet to keep": {
      "comment": "SettingsAccountsMac (Sources/Features/SettingsAccountsMac/AccountsWords.swift:21). machine-translated, owner review pending.",
      "extractionState": "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
