    "Three things make the AI parts work. Set them now or later: Whoosh marks what is missing.": {
      "comment": "AISetup (Sources/Features/AISetup/AISetupWords.swift:55). English and French written by hand; the other 12 machine-translated, owner review pending.",
      "extractionState": "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tre ting får AI-delene til at virke. Sæt dem op nu eller senere: Whoosh markerer, hvad der mangler."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drei Dinge lassen die KI-Teile funktionieren. Richten Sie sie jetzt oder später ein: Whoosh markiert, was fehlt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Three things make the AI parts work. Set them now or later: Whoosh marks what is missing."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tres cosas hacen funcionar las partes de IA. Configúralas ahora o más tarde: Whoosh marca lo que falta."
          }
        },
        "fi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kolme asiaa saa tekoälyosat toimimaan. Määritä ne nyt tai myöhemmin: Whoosh merkitsee, mikä puuttuu."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trois éléments font fonctionner les parties IA. Réglez-les maintenant ou plus tard : Whoosh signale ce qui manque."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tre cose fanno funzionare le parti di IA. Impostale ora o più tardi: Whoosh segnala ciò che manca."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI の機能には3つのものが必要です。今でも後でも設定できます。足りないものは Whoosh が示します。"
          }
        },
        "nb": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tre ting får AI-delene til å virke. Sett dem opp nå eller senere: Whoosh markerer hva som mangler."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Drie dingen laten de AI-onderdelen werken. Stel ze nu of later in: Whoosh markeert wat ontbreekt."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Trzy rzeczy sprawiają, że funkcje AI działają. Ustaw je teraz lub później: Whoosh zaznaczy, czego brakuje."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Três coisas fazem as partes de IA funcionar. Configure-as agora ou mais tarde: o Whoosh assinala o que falta."
          }
        },
        "sv": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tre saker får AI-delarna att fungera. Ställ in dem nu eller senare: Whoosh markerar vad som saknas."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "三样东西让 AI 功能运转。现在或稍后设置均可:缺少的部分 Whoosh 会标出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
