    "How long a new mail shows before the notch closes by itself.": {
      "comment": "SettingsGeneralMac, Notch (Sources/Features/SettingsGeneralMac/GeneralWords.swift; the notch's alerts, 14 Nov 2026). machine-translated, owner review pending.",
      "extractionState": "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations": {
