    "This model needs a sign-in on Hugging Face. Whoosh downloads public models only.": {
      "comment": "SettingsAIMac (Sources/Features/SettingsAIMac/AIWords.swift). Refusal of the line Other model: the model is gated. machine-translated, owner review pending.",
