    "Whoosh cannot run this model: its kind (%@) is not one it knows.": {
      "comment": "SettingsAIMac (Sources/Features/SettingsAIMac/AIWords.swift). Refusal of the line Other model: the model's kind (model_type of its config.json, shown as is) is not one the app runs. machine-translated, owner review pending.",
