    "Whoosh cannot run this model yet: it reads decisions through its own head.": {
      "comment": "SettingsAIMac (Sources/Features/SettingsAIMac/AIWords.swift). Refusal of the line Other model: the model has a decision_config.json (its own decision head). machine-translated, owner review pending.",
